msgid "Library Registry"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../librarymanager/dependencies.rst:35
msgid ""
"|PIOREGISTRY| contains a rich set of popular libraries with examples and "
"instructions on how to add them to your project. Libraries in PlatformIO are "
"isolated between projects and project environments. This helps you to avoid "
"conflicts or break existing projects when you update libraries to the newest "
"versions."
msgstr ""

